---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="カナデ (Kanade) 言語" customMaxWidth="max-w-5xl">
  <section class="pt-14 pb-24 grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] lg:items-center">
    <div>
      <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-5xl sm:text-7xl leading-[1.3]" style="letter-spacing:-0.04em" aria-label="奏でて、叶える。">
        <ruby>奏<rt>かな</rt></ruby>でて、<br /><span class="text-gradient"><ruby>叶<rt>かな</rt></ruby>える。</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-ink" style="letter-spacing:-0.02em">日本語で始めるプログラミング</p>

      <a href="https://haja.soumt.moe" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-8 text-sm text-ink-soft hover:text-ink transition-colors group">
        <img src="/haja-logo.svg" class="w-5 h-5 rounded" alt="Haja" />
        <span>韓国語プログラミング言語「Haja」公式日本語版 <span class="text-ink-faint group-hover:text-verb transition-colors">→</span></span>
      </a>

      <p class="mt-7 text-lg text-ink-soft leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
        英語が苦手でも、誰でも簡単にコードを読み書きできます。<br />
        英語、もう見なくていいですでオブジェクト指向プログラミングを始めましょう。
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-4 mt-10">
        <a href="/docs/intro" class="bg-ink text-white px-7 py-3.5 font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-verb transition-colors">
          始める
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/tutorial/1-variables" class="border border-rule px-7 py-3.5 font-semibold rounded-xl hover:border-ink transition-colors">
          文法を見る
        </a>
        <a href="/playground" class="font-semibold text-ink hover:text-verb transition-colors px-2">
          プレイグラウンドで試す →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 同じプログラムを、韓国語(Haja)と日本語(Kanade)で。 -->
    <div class="flex flex-col items-stretch gap-3" aria-label="HajaとKanadeのコード比較">
      <figure class="hj-panel">
        <figcaption class="hj-panel-head">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><img src="/haja-logo.svg" alt="" class="w-4 h-4 rounded-sm" />Haja</span>
          <span>韓国語</span>
        </figcaption>
        <pre class="p-5 sm:p-6 text-[13px] leading-[2] font-mono overflow-x-auto m-0"><code><span class="tk-fn">&lt;인사하기&gt;</span><span class="tk-par">를</span> <span class="tk-verb">만들자</span> (<span class="tk-type">[문자열]</span><span class="tk-par">인</span> <span class="tk-var">'이름'</span>):
    <span class="tk-str">틀"안녕, &#123;</span><span class="tk-var">'이름'</span><span class="tk-str">&#125;!"</span><span class="tk-par">을</span> <span class="tk-verb">출력하자</span>

<span class="tk-fn">&lt;인사하기&gt;</span>(<span class="tk-str">"카나데"</span>)<span class="tk-par">를</span> <span class="tk-verb">실행하자</span></code></pre>
      </figure>

      <div class="flex justify-center text-ink-faint" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 5v14m0 0l-6-6m6 6l6-6" /></svg>
      </div>

      <figure class="hj-panel hj-out" style="border-color:var(--color-ink)">
        <figcaption class="hj-out-head">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" class="w-4 h-4 rounded-sm" />Kanade</span>
          <span class="ml-auto">日本語</span>
        </figcaption>
        <pre class="p-5 sm:p-6 text-[13px] leading-[2] font-mono overflow-x-auto m-0"><code><span class="tk-fn">〈挨拶する〉</span><span class="tk-par">を</span><span class="tk-verb">作ろう</span> (<span class="tk-type">【文字列】</span><span class="tk-par">の</span><span class="tk-var">『名前』</span>):
    <span class="tk-str">枠「こんにちは、&#123;</span><span class="tk-var">『名前』</span><span class="tk-str">&#125;！」</span><span class="tk-par">を</span><span class="tk-verb">出力しよう</span>

<span class="tk-fn">〈挨拶する〉</span>(<span class="tk-str">「カナデ」</span>)<span class="tk-par">を</span><span class="tk-verb">実行しよう</span></code></pre>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
